        "en": "“Forgot passphrase?” opens recovery: enter the kit’s 24 words or its QR-code text, or read the QR: “Scan the QR” with the camera on phones, “QR from a picture” from a photo or screenshot everywhere (decoded on the device, sent nowhere), or, on a trusted device with device unlock enabled, choose “This trusted device”. Then set a new passphrase.",
