        "en": "The device remembers the fingerprint of its vault key and checks every key it receives against it — on passphrase, Recovery Key or biometric unlock, device approval and enabling sync. If the server sends a different key, the “Different vault key” screen appears: data on the device stays unchanged, sync stops and there is no way to accept the “new” key. Do not enter secrets on that device; choose “Copy diagnostics” and tell the server administrator.",
