        "en": "In the Cmd+K / Ctrl+K palette, choose New local terminal. macOS opens zsh immediately; Windows offers PowerShell, cmd and individual WSL distributions.",
        "es": "En la paleta Cmd+K / Ctrl+K, seleccione Nuevo terminal local. macOS abre zsh inmediatamente; Windows ofrece distribuciones PowerShell, cmd e individuales WSL.",
        "zh": "在Cmd+K / Ctrl+K调色板中,选择新的本地终端. macOS立即打开zsh; Windows提供PowerShell,cmd和单个WSL分布."
