        "en": "Prefer 127.0.0.1 for a local service needed only by you. A non-loopback address (such as 0.0.0.0) shows a “Not bound to loopback” warning, and the tunnel can be saved only after ticking “I understand this tunnel is reachable from the network”. For remote forwarding such an address works only if the SSH server allows GatewayPorts.",
