        "en": "Cassandra structure: keyspaces with their replication → tables, materialized views, user types, functions and aggregates → columns marked PARTITION KEY, CLUSTERING ASC/DESC and STATIC. A cell can be edited when the result holds the whole primary key: rows are updated with UPDATE … IF EXISTS, and rows of one partition in one conditional BATCH (all or none). Different partitions do not change together — the review warns about it.",
