        "en": "The Ingress should pass only /v1, /healthz and /readyz, forward the /v1/events/ws WebSocket, accept request bodies up to 16 MiB and never rewrite the path, query or body: requests are signed. Do not publish metrics port 9090 through the Ingress.",
